# Premium 3D Models

This project has a full 3D-modeling skill at
`skills/premium-3d-models/SKILL.md` in this repo (or wherever you copied
the `skills/premium-3d-models/` folder). Read that file in full before
building any model — it covers the persona-and-use-case step, the model-spec
format, the four generator/QA scripts (`build_model.py`, `validate_model.py`,
`render_preview.py`, `blender_import.py`), and integration guides for
Flutter/web/Blender.

Quick reference:
- Ask (briefly) whether this is an "engineer" (precise, dimensioned,
  mechanical) or "designer" (organic/sculptural) piece if it's not obvious
  — see `skills/premium-3d-models/references/personas.md`.
- Build via `build_model.py` (trimesh + manifold3d CSG) — real geometry,
  not an AI mesh generator, and honest about not doing true fillets or
  organic freeform sculpting.
- Always run `validate_model.py` (watertight/manifold check) before
  delivering — a broken mesh looks fine in a glance and fails silently in
  a slicer, physics engine, or AR viewer.
- Always render a preview (`render_preview.py --mode hero` or
  `--mode multiview`) and look at it before handing the model over.
